{
  "version": "1",
  "description": "Figure 4 (weekdays column) of Wurgaft et al. 2026 (arXiv:2605.05115): read the un-intervened weekday probabilities of the 49-prompt pool and fit the behavior manifold to them; harvest the layer-28 activations, fit 48 principal components and a periodic cubic spline through the seven weekday centroids (the activation manifold); steer the 21 centroid pairs along the spline and along the chord over the paper code's 16 base prompts; and score both trajectories' cumulative Bhattacharyya energy against the behavior manifold. Every edge is a reference to an earlier step's output. scripts/manifold_fig4/fig4_figure.py draws the figure from the manifold_path, behavior and energy steps.",
  "output_dir": "manifold_fig4",
  "steps": {
    "baseline": {
      "type": "intervention_protocol",
      "document": "../protocols/manifold_fig4_baseline.json"
    },
